KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
JAMB - Chemistry (Year 2022)

Q1. What is the oxidation state of chromium in K2Cr2O7?
  (A) +3
  (B) +5
  (C) +6
  (D) +7
  Answer: C - 2(+1) + 2(x) + 7(-2) = 0 => 2 + 2x - 14 = 0 => 2x = 12 => x = +6.


